\tag{fnip}
\title{Center manifolds}
\date{2026-11-26}

\p{The homeomorphism of \ref{fnip-0043} carries the orbits near a
[hyperbolic](fnip-0034) [equilibrium](fnip-0014) onto the linear
orbits. When an eigenvalue has real part zero, the homeomorphism
of \ref{fnip-0043} is not given.}

\p{Which invariant manifold through the equilibrium carries the motion
along that eigenspace?}

\transclude{fnip-0058}
